<p>BORROWER WHITMAN CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.29 PCT   MATURITY 09/15/26</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE 03/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA2    SPREAD 53 BP	PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
